{
  "schema_id": "hsk.work_packet_contract@2",
  "_notes": [
    "V1 (hsk.work_packet_contract@1) stays the contract for WP-KERNEL-012 and its @1 files; V2 applies from the next WP on.",
    "Paperwork is handwritten in this repo; digests, activation_id and controller-derived refs are optional (null) until Handshake exists.",
    "Policy prose lives in rule_refs (Codex CX ids), never in instance fields; keys starting with '_' are author comments and are ignored by readers.",
    "mt_state is the single MT projection; mt_plan.mt_status, tracker.mt_status and microtasks.authored_count are removed.",
    "Value mapping from V1 labels: PASS_Vn -> phase passed / decision pass; FAIL_Vn -> needs_remediation / fail; PARTIAL -> validating / inconclusive plus a blockers[] entry on the MT.",
    "lifecycle.phase is authoritative; lifecycle.status is the derived label <DECISION>_V<n> kept for old readers.",
    "mt_plan.clusters fold into microtask_graph.parallel_groups; build_target stays inside architecture_binding for the single-crate reality.",
    "Placeholders are REPLACE_ME or empty arrays; scope_waivers keep 012's waivers_granted names as aliases under _v1_alias."
  ],
